  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFEX is a global network for FE and is working for local members in many countries. The distribute alerts and train in advocacy, as well as approaching the legislative level. The work on increasing capacity of members and themselves, and on financial support.  The support to IFEX seapa is mainly regarding capacity building and organisational development of IFEX groups in SEAPA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFEX &#xe4;r ett globalt YF-n&#xe4;tverk som arbetar med st&#xf6;d till lokala medlemmar runt om i v&#xe4;rlden. De sprider sk Alerts n&#xe4;r n&#xe5;gon  felbehandlas och skapar opinion s&#xe5; att n&#xe5;got h&#xe4;nder. De jobbar ocks&#xe5; med att f&#xe5; sm&#xe5; lokala org duktigare och finansiellt sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndiga, bla genom mikrol&#xe5;n.</narrative>
  </description>
